MapNest is a configuration and administration layer for MapServer. It does
not include MapServer's source code; at run time it uses these projects,
each under its own license:

- MapServer (https://mapserver.org), an OSGeo project: MIT-style license.
  All map rendering, WMS and WFS are done by MapServer.
- GDAL (https://gdal.org): MIT license. Raster access.
- PROJ (https://proj.org): MIT license.
- The camptocamp/mapserver Docker image (https://github.com/camptocamp/docker-mapserver).
- OpenLayers (https://openlayers.org): BSD 2-Clause license.
- Go and npm dependencies listed in server/msapi/go.mod and web/package.json,
  under their respective licenses.
